   "label": "Decode.auto",
   "kind": 3,
   "detail": "Decoder 'a",
   "documentation": {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "value": "A decoder derived from the type it is used at: records, sum types (`{\"type\": …, \"fields\": […]}`), tuples, `List`, `Set`, `Map`, `Option` (`null` or the value) and the primitives, recursively. Round-trips `Encode.auto`."
   }
  },
