   "label": "Async.sleep",
   "kind": 3,
   "detail": "float -> Async unit",
   "documentation": {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "value": "Pause for the given seconds. `asyncio.sleep`."
   }
  },
  {
   "label": "Async.timeout",
   "kind": 3,
   "detail": "float -> (Async 'a) -> Async (Option 'a)",
   "documentation": {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "value": "Await a value with a deadline in seconds: `Some` the result, or `None` if it ran out. `asyncio.wait_for`."
   }
  },
  {
   "label": "Async.toThread",
   "kind": 3,
   "detail": "(unit -> 'a) -> Async 'a",
   "documentation": {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "value": "Run a blocking thunk on a worker thread and await its result, keeping the event loop free. `asyncio.to_thread`."
   }
  },
  {
   "label": "Async.parallel",
   "kind": 3,
   "detail": "(List (Async 'a)) -> Async (List 'a)",
   "documentation": {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "value": "Await every value at once and collect the results in order. `asyncio.gather`."
   }
  },
  {
   "label": "Async.race",
   "kind": 3,
   "detail": "(List (Async 'a)) -> Async 'a",
   "documentation": {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "value": "Await the first value to finish and cancel the rest; the list must be non-empty (an empty race raises `ValueError` at the await). `asyncio.wait(FIRST_COMPLETED)`."
   }
  },
  {
   "label": "Async.catch",
   "kind": 3,
   "detail": "(Async 'a) -> Async (Result 'a Exception)",
   "documentation": {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "value": "Await a value, turning an exception raised at the await into `Error` with the same `Exception` record `try` builds. Cancellation passes through."
   }
  },
  {
   "label": "Task.scope",
   "kind": 3,
   "detail": "(Async 'a) -> Async 'a",
   "documentation": {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "value": "Run an async body inside a scope: every task started in it is joined or cancelled when the body ends, and one failure cancels the rest. `asyncio.TaskGroup`."
   }
  },
  {
   "label": "Task.start",
   "kind": 3,
   "detail": "(Async unit) ->{spawn} unit",
   "documentation": {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "value": "Start a task in the enclosing `Task.scope`, which owns it. Performs `spawn`, which only a scope discharges, so a start outside one is a compile error."
   }
  },
  {
   "label": "Encode.auto",
   "kind": 3,
   "detail": "'a -> string",
   "documentation": {
    "kind": "markdown",
    "value": "Encode any value with a JSON form to a JSON string: records as objects, sum-type cases as `{\"type\": …, \"fields\": […]}`, `Option` as `null` or the value, a `Map` with string keys as an object and any other as a list of pairs. Round-trips `Decode.auto`."
   }
